{"idx": 12, "speaker": "雪菜", "type": "台词", "mood": "轻声", "text": "“呐，呐…以后，也可以，和你通电话吗？”", "start": 60.07, "dur": 4.6, "emotion": "开心", "emotion_score": 0.965, "hyp": "那,那,以后也可以和你通电话吗?", "cer": 0.154, "sim_real": 0.565, "sim_anchor": 0.756, "near_anchor": "雪菜", "near_real": "雪菜", "f0": 242.4, "rate": 2.82, "jump": 1.06}
